# dcstools_data volume

Subsequent test data, work products, and goldens go here, not on `/data/disk2`:

`/zdswhst2/ST_BIOINTEL/P24Z32400N0004/wanruiwen/dcstools_data`

- `golden/` is `$GOLDEN_ROOT`. `work/` is `$WORK_ROOT`. Do not recreate `dcstools-test-suite/work` or `dcstools-test-suite/golden`.
- Disk quota may report full, but writes still succeed. Do not treat "quota full" as a blocker for writing here.
- 30x FASTQ: `.../dcstools_data/HG001_30x` (`WGS30X_DATA`).
- ERT ref: `.../wanruiwen/ref_ert/hg38.fa` (`WGS30X_ERT_REF`, `--use-high-memory-index`).
- Minibwa ref: `.../wanruiwen/ref_minibwa/hg38.fa` (`WGS30X_MINIBWA_REF`, `--use-minibwa`).
